MATRIX: Min-max normalisation. A constant column stays at zero.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE columnmin WITH row
  BUGATTI best EQUALS CALL at (row, 0)
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 1
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN CALL length WITH row
    IF CALL at (row, i) IS LESS THAN best THEN
      BUGATTI best EQUALS CALL at (row, i)
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT best
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE columnmax WITH row
  BUGATTI best EQUALS CALL at (row, 0)
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 1
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN CALL length WITH row
    IF CALL at (row, i) IS GREATER THAN best THEN
      BUGATTI best EQUALS CALL at (row, i)
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT best
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE scale WITH row
  BUGATTI lo EQUALS CALL columnmin WITH row
  BUGATTI hi EQUALS CALL columnmax WITH row
  BUGATTI span EQUALS hi MINUS lo
  BUGATTI out EQUALS []
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN CALL length WITH row
    IF span IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
      BUGATTI out EQUALS out PLUS [0]
    OTHERWISE YOU ARE A BETA
      BUGATTI out EQUALS out PLUS [(CALL at (row, i) MINUS lo) DIVIDED BY span]
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT out
DONE HUSTLING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL scale WITH [10, 20, 30]
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL scale WITH [4, 4, 4]

